{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"玛丽·居里·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"marie-curie","categoryLabel":"玛丽·居里","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/30_marie-curie/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"玛丽-居里的代表成就\">玛丽·居里的代表成就</h1><p>本卷以&quot;里程碑&quot;为线索，盘点居里夫人一生中最具标志性的成就与荣誉——两座诺贝尔奖、一连串载入史册的&quot;第一&quot;，以及战时放射救护与研究建制的开创性功绩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷讲什么-不讲什么\">本卷讲什么、不讲什么</h2><p>本卷聚焦&quot;成就事件&quot;本身：它们何时发生、规模如何、为何重要、又常被如何误传。它<strong>不</strong>复述科学内容、生平脉络或后世评价——那些属于兄弟卷。明确的分工边界如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>她&quot;如何成为科学家&quot;</td>\n<td>本卷只取与成就直接相关的节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>她&quot;为科学留下了什么&quot;（内容）</td>\n<td>放射性、钋镭、镭标准的科学细节在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>她&quot;如何思考与工作&quot;</td>\n<td>治学气质与价值观在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>代表成就（本卷）</strong></td>\n<td>她的成就&quot;凝结成哪些标志性事件&quot;</td>\n<td>奖项·第一·战时·建制的事件特写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>这些成就&quot;产生了什么长期回响&quot;</td>\n<td>当代续篇与文化纪念在那里</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>后人&quot;如何评判她&quot;</td>\n<td>朗之万事件、辐射危害、史学评价在那里</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：核心贡献讲&quot;科学内容&quot;，本卷讲这些内容&quot;凝结成的标志性事件&quot;，影响与遗产讲这些事件&quot;日后的回响&quot;。同一事实只在主篇展开，跨卷以相对路径互链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷三章\">本卷三章</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>第一章 两座诺贝尔奖</strong>：<a href=\"two-nobel-prizes/the-1903-physics-nobel\">1903 物理学奖</a>（共享·提名风波·首位女性得主）与 <a href=\"two-nobel-prizes/the-1911-chemistry-nobel\">1911 化学奖</a>（独得·跨双领域·舆论风暴中领奖）。</li>\n<li><strong>第二章 历史的第一</strong>：<a href=\"historic-firsts/records-and-recognitions\">载入史册的诸多纪录</a>（虚实辨析）与 <a href=\"historic-firsts/first-woman-professor-at-the-sorbonne\">索邦首位女教授</a>（制度性突破特写）。</li>\n<li><strong>第三章 战时与建制</strong>：<a href=\"wartime-and-institutions/the-petites-curies-of-world-war-i\">一战中的&quot;小居里&quot;</a>（可核验的救护规模）与 <a href=\"wartime-and-institutions/the-radium-institutes-as-legacy\">镭研究所</a>（把发现变成永续机构）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;  P[前置:核心贡献&lt;br/&gt;了解放射性与钋镭] --&gt; A[1903 物理学奖]&#10;  A --&gt; B[1911 化学奖]&#10;  B --&gt; C[历史的第一·纪录辨析]&#10;  C --&gt; D[索邦首位女教授]&#10;  D --&gt; E[一战·小居里]&#10;  E --&gt; F[镭研究所·制度化]&#10;  F --&gt; G[延伸:影响与遗产]\">flowchart LR\n  P[前置:核心贡献&lt;br/&gt;了解放射性与钋镭] --&gt; A[1903 物理学奖]\n  A --&gt; B[1911 化学奖]\n  B --&gt; C[历史的第一·纪录辨析]\n  C --&gt; D[索邦首位女教授]\n  D --&gt; E[一战·小居里]\n  E --&gt; F[镭研究所·制度化]\n  F --&gt; G[延伸:影响与遗产]</pre><p><strong>前置建议</strong>：先读 <a href=\"../core-contributions/founding-radioactivity/the-concept-of-radioactivity\">核心贡献·放射性的概念</a>，理解放射性与钋、镭是什么，再读本卷会更通透——本卷不重复这些科学内容。<strong>路径建议</strong>：按&quot;两座奖 → 历史第一 → 战时与建制&quot;顺序阅读，可循&quot;个人荣誉 → 制度承认 → 服务社会 → 永续机构&quot;这条由内向外的逻辑线展开；读完后衔接 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a> 看长期回响。</p>\n<p>这些里程碑不仅是个人荣誉，更是科学史与女性史上的标志性节点，集中展现了居里夫人成就的广度与开创性。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"two-nobel-prizes","title":"两座诺贝尔奖","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works/two-nobel-prizes","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-1903-physics-nobel","title":"1903 年诺贝尔物理学奖","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works/two-nobel-prizes/the-1903-physics-nobel"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-1911-chemistry-nobel","title":"1911 年诺贝尔化学奖","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works/two-nobel-prizes/the-1911-chemistry-nobel"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"historic-firsts","title":"开创性的历史第一","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works/historic-firsts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"records-and-recognitions","title":"载入史册的诸多纪录","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works/historic-firsts/records-and-recognitions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"first-woman-professor-at-the-sorbonne","title":"索邦大学首位女教授","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works/historic-firsts/first-woman-professor-at-the-sorbonne"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"wartime-and-institutions","title":"战时贡献与研究建制","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works/wartime-and-institutions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-petites-curies-of-world-war-i","title":"第一次世界大战中的\"小居里\"","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works/wartime-and-institutions/the-petites-curies-of-world-war-i"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-radium-institutes-as-legacy","title":"镭研究所：成就的制度化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/marie-curie/major-works/wartime-and-institutions/the-radium-institutes-as-legacy"}]}]}